{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s15BitwiseCopyableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/Se","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SE","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SQ","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SH","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/childof"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Hierarchy.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Hierarchy.swift#L51"},"title":"ChildOf","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:11WorldModule7ChildOfV","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ChildOf","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ChildOf","kind":"identifier"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/init()","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/init(from:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"anchor":"Type-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/isExclusive","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/onTargetDespawn"],"title":"Type Properties"},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/Equatable-Implementations","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/Relation-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ChildOf","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A hierarchy groups entities into trees: a ship and its turrets, a menu and its buttons. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity has at most one parent, and despawning a parent despawns its children, and theirs in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turn. Build a hierarchy with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/addChild(_:to:)"},{"type":"text","text":", which refuses a link that would make"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an entity its own ancestor, and walk it with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/parent(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/children(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/ancestors(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/descendants(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example attaches a turret and an engine to a ship, then despawns the ship,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which takes its parts with it:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Ship\"))","let turret = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Turret\"))","let engine = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Engine\"))","try world.addChild(turret, to: ship)","try world.addChild(engine, to: ship)","","let parts = world.children(of: ship).map { world[Name.self, of: $0].value }","print(parts)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"Turret\", \"Engine\"]\"","","world.despawn(ship)","print(world.contains(engine))","\/\/ Prints \"false\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"ChildOf","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" like any other, so an entity with a parent holds a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Targets<ChildOf>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" component naming it. Queries use that to find the entities at each level","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of a tree:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".related(ChildOf.self, to: parent)"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps the children of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"parent"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".with(Targets<ChildOf>.self)"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps entities that have a parent."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".without(Targets<ChildOf>.self)"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps the roots."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","let menu = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Menu\"))","let play = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Play\"))","let quit = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Quit\"))","try world.addChild(play, to: menu)","try world.addChild(quit, to: menu)","","print(world.query(Name.self).related(ChildOf.self, to: menu).count)","\/\/ Prints \"2\"","print(world.query(Name.self).without(Targets<ChildOf>.self).count)","\/\/ Prints \"1\""],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The relation that links a child entity to its parent."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Building-Hierarchies","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AncestorsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/DescendantsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CyclicHierarchy","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/HierarchyError"],"title":"Building Hierarchies"}],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/SQ":{"title":"Swift.Equatable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SQ"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/ChildOf/Relation-Implementations":{"abstract":[],"role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/Relation-Implementations","kind":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/childof\/relation-implementations","title":"Relation Implementations"},"doc://WorldModule/Se":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/Se","title":"Swift.Decodable","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/children(of:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the children of an entity, in the order they were added."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"children","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"of","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/children(of:)","title":"children(of:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/docu